msgstr "Hujah untuk persamaan pembezaan Black-Scholes berada pada domain tetap, seperti berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$t$ is between 0 and 0.9. The variable $x_i$ of each asset is between 0 and 1, and the price of the asset is $S_i = 1 + x_i$, so between 1 and 2.\n"
