# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansatz {#ansatz}"
msgstr "Ansatz {#ansatz}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The variable quantum circuit that encodes each function is selected with the `ansatz` argument:\n"
msgstr "Litar kuantum variasi yang mengekod setiap fungsi dipilih dengan hujah `ansatz`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`HEA` is a hardware-efficient ansatz measured with a global observable. It is the most general choice.\n"
msgstr "`HEA` ialah ansatz cekap perkakasan yang diukur dengan observable global. Ia ialah pilihan yang paling umum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`BPM-LE` (Barren Plateau Mitigation, Low Expressivity) is an ansatz designed to avoid barren plateaus, measured with local observables. It has few parameters and shallow circuits, which keeps the cost of the optimization low, including the cost of parameter-shift gradients.\n"
msgstr "`BPM-LE` (Barren Plateau Mitigation, Low Expressivity) ialah ansatz yang direka untuk mengelakkan barren plateau, diukur dengan observable setempat. Ia mempunyai sedikit parameter dan litar yang cetek, yang memastikan kos pengoptimuman rendah, termasuk kos kecerunan parameter-shift.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`BPM-HE` (Barren Plateau Mitigation, High Expressivity) follows the same construction with more parameters per circuit, for functions that the low-expressivity version cannot represent accurately enough.\n"
msgstr "`BPM-HE` (Barren Plateau Mitigation, High Expressivity) mengikut pembinaan yang sama dengan lebih banyak parameter bagi setiap litar, untuk fungsi yang tidak dapat diwakili dengan cukup tepat oleh versi ekspresiviti rendah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The number of qubits per variable and the depth of the circuit remain controlled by the `nb_qubits` and `depth` arguments.\n"
msgstr "Bilangan qubit bagi setiap pemboleh ubah dan kedalaman litar kekal dikawal oleh argumen `nb_qubits` dan `depth`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimizer chain and error metric {#optimizer-chain-and-error-metric}"
msgstr "Rantaian pengoptimum dan metrik ralat {#optimizer-chain-and-error-metric}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optimizers are chained as a list of stages with the `optimizers` argument. Each stage defines its own method, its maximum number of iterations and its own number of shots, so that cheap and noisy evaluations explore the landscape first, and the number of shots increases as the optimization converges. A typical chain is made of the following pieces:\n"
msgstr "Pengoptimum dirantai sebagai senarai peringkat dengan argumen `optimizers`. Setiap peringkat mentakrifkan kaedahnya sendiri, bilangan lelaran maksimumnya dan bilangan shot tersendiri, supaya penilaian yang murah dan berhingar meneroka landskap terlebih dahulu, dan bilangan shot meningkat apabila pengoptimuman menumpu. Rantaian tipikal terdiri daripada bahagian berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "One or more `CMAES` stages (global and gradient-free), which identify the right region of the space of solutions. Each stage has its own `shots`, `sigma0`, and `popsize` (population size, that is the number of candidates evaluated at each generation). The `sigma0` argument is the initial standard deviation of the search distribution of CMA-ES, that is, its initial step size: a large value widely explores the space of the circuit parameters, while a small value searches locally around the best candidate found so far. Decreasing `sigma0` from one stage to the next therefore moves from exploration to refinement.\n"
msgstr "Satu atau lebih peringkat `CMAES` (global dan tanpa kecerunan), yang mengenal pasti kawasan yang betul dalam ruang penyelesaian. Setiap peringkat mempunyai `shots`, `sigma0` dan `popsize` tersendiri (saiz populasi, iaitu bilangan calon yang dinilai pada setiap generasi). Argumen `sigma0` ialah sisihan piawai awal bagi taburan carian CMA-ES, iaitu saiz langkah awalnya: nilai besar meneroka ruang parameter litar secara meluas, manakala nilai kecil mencari secara setempat di sekitar calon terbaik yang ditemui setakat ini. Oleh itu, mengurangkan `sigma0` dari satu peringkat ke peringkat seterusnya beralih daripada penerokaan kepada penghalusan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A `LS-TRF` stage (Least Squares - Trust Region Reflective), which explores this region to refine the final angles. Without `psr`, `LS-TRF` estimates the Jacobian of the cost function with finite differences. With `psr=True`, the Jacobian is computed on the QPU exactly, with the parameter-shift rule (PSR). The PSR increases the computation time since it requires additional circuits, but it allows a better precision than the finite differences.\n"
msgstr "Satu peringkat `LS-TRF` (Least Squares - Trust Region Reflective), yang meneroka kawasan ini untuk menghalusi sudut akhir. Tanpa `psr`, `LS-TRF` menganggar Jacobian bagi fungsi kos dengan beza terhingga. Dengan `psr=True`, Jacobian dikira pada QPU dengan tepat, menggunakan petua parameter-shift (PSR). PSR meningkatkan masa pengiraan kerana memerlukan litar tambahan, tetapi ia membolehkan ketepatan yang lebih baik daripada beza terhingga.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The error metric used on this page is the Root Mean Square Error (RMSE) between the solution and the reference solution, over the sampled points. The function also reports the mean squared error (MSE) and the maximum absolute deviation, which are the d2 and d1 metrics of Section 2.6 of [the H-DES paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.01130).\n"
msgstr "Metrik ralat yang digunakan pada halaman ini ialah Root Mean Square Error (RMSE) antara penyelesaian dan penyelesaian rujukan, pada titik yang disampel. Fungsi ini juga melaporkan mean squared error (MSE) dan sisihan mutlak maksimum, iaitu metrik d2 dan d1 dalam Seksyen 2.6 [kertas H-DES](https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.01130).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarks {#benchmarks}"
msgstr "Penanda Aras {#benchmarks}"

